540 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 374 0 R
/E (Hospitals are places with lots of data but little insight. Admission records, billing entries, medication use, lab tests, doctor appointments, and bed assignments are all produced by every patient encounter; however, the value of this data is only revealed when it is combined, visualized, and analyzed. This aggregation is carried out across six interconnected pages in the Hospital Dashboard, which is based on Power BI: Home, Overview, Patient, Doctor, Hospital, and Finance.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
