<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 378 0 R
/E (Leadership begins with the overview; care teams utilize the patient and doctor views, operations teams use the hospital page, and the finance team uses the finance page. This six-page layout reflects how a hospital actually runs. Although this division improves user experience, cross-page insights, such as the cost-revenue disparity, only become apparent when the perspectives are viewed collectively, as this report does.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
