648 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 378 0 R
/E (Every admitted patient generated exactly one bill when the patient count and bill count matched at 30. This resulted in a clean billing procedure with no duplicate or missing invoices. At the time the dashboard was updated, 22 of the 30 patients had been released \(73%\) and 8 were still in the hospital, indicating a strong case throughput. Clinical experience is qualitatively validated by the 5-star Overview evaluation and the comment "Diabetes management advice was helpful.")
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
