<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 405 0 R
/E (The data's strongest indication is that the hospital's economics are driven by both the private ward and surgery, with the pharmacy being the most underappreciated profit center. The four medication stock-outs, which all cater to the middle-aged chronic-care patient group that predominates in intake, are the most critical operational signal. Strategically, the three levers most likely to significantly boost performance over the next two quarters are doctor compensation, surgical throughput, and dashboard scope \(a missing Total Revenue KPI\).)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
